{"version":1,"content":"<p>圈中模範夫妻張繼聰（阿聰）與謝安琪（Kay）近日孖公仔受訪，宣傳阿聰明年1月演出的舞台劇《Rabbit Hole心渦》，兩人回答多條夫妻情境題，阿聰全程展現滿滿的求生欲，氹得老婆哈哈大笑，閃爆網民。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T14:23:58.467415+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T14:01:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:16.458383+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:16.458383+00:00","content_hash":"4d415a6cc468289c1a32888fc0a6abba2513b1ff154292268b89b10ff600875f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}